us":"published","sortOrder":0},{"kind":"news","title":"Top 5 fuel-efficient 4x4 vehicles suited for Zambian highway and gravel conditions","summary":"","body":"","imageKey":"/assets/images/car_review_mat_suv_1793016494055.jpg","meta":"","videoUrl":"","status":"published","sortOrder":1},{"kind":"news","title":"Why hybrid and electric vehicles are gaining momentum for urban commuting in Lusaka","summary":"","body":"","imageKey":"/assets/images/hero_yellow_ev_hatchback_1793016491792.jpg","meta":"","videoUrl":"","status":"published","sortOrder":2},{"kind":"video","title":"Is the NEW BMW X5 still the ultimate luxury SUV for cross-country touring?","summary":"","body":"","imageKey":"/assets/images/car_review_mat_suv_1793016494055.jpg","meta":"","videoUrl":"","status":"published","sortOrder":0},{"kind":"video","title":"Full Off-Road & Endurance Test: Luxury 4x4 comparison and clearance","summary":"","body":"","imageKey":"/assets/images/jaecoo_compact_suv_1793016492784.jpg","meta":"","videoUrl":"","status":"published","sortOrder":1},{"kind":"video","title":"Compact EV & Hybrid Efficiency Test: Real world fuel consumption breakdown","summary":"","body":"","imageKey":"/assets/images/hero_yellow_ev_hatchback_1793016491792.jpg","meta":"","videoUrl":"","status":"published","sortOrder":2}],"faqs":[{"question":"What is AutoAce Zed?","answer":"AutoAce Zed is a Zambian vehicle sourcing and procurement coordination platform. We are not a traditional car dealership holding inventory; instead, we connect individuals and businesses seeking vehicles with vetted vehicle agents, clearing specialists, and private sellers across Zambia.","active":true,"sortOrder":0},{"question":"How does vehicle sourcing work for buyers?","answer":"Simply describe the car you need—or specify your budget in Zambian Kwacha (ZMW)—along with your preferred location (Lusaka, Ndola, Kitwe, etc.). Our coordination desk matches your request with authorized agents and verified listings, communicating directly with you on WhatsApp.","active":true,"sortOrder":1},{"question":"How do I sell my car on AutoAce Zed?","answer":"Submit your vehicle make, model, year, mileage, condition, asking price in ZMW, and photos. Our coordinators review the submission and share it with pre-qualified buyers and sourcing agents looking for that profile. There are no automated false valuations or upfront listing fees.","active":true,"sortOrder":2},{"question":"How can vehicle agents and sourcing partners join?","answer":"If you are a professional vehicle sourcing agent, import clearing partner, or dealership in Zambia, you can register interest through our \"Join as an Agent\" flow. Once vetted, you will receive customer sourcing requests matching your operating towns and vehicle specializations.","active":true,"sortOrder":3},{"question":"Does AutoAce Zed charge buyers for making a request?","answer":"No. Submitting a sourcing request or vehicle enquiry on AutoAce Zed is free. You will receive quotes and vehicle options with transparent pricing from participating sourcing partners.","active":true,"sortOrder":4}]}